<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n49312" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">trulla</span></b> , ae, f.
		dim.
		trua. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>, <i>a small ladle</i>,
				<i>dipper</i>, or <i>scoop</i> (esp.
			for dipping wine from the crater into the drinking-cups), <i><span class="en">Varr. L. L. 5, § 118</span></i>;
					<i><span class="en">Cato, R. R. 13, 2 sq.</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Cic. Verr. 2, 4, 27, § 62 sq.</span></i>;
				<i><span class="en">Hor.
				S. 2, 3, 144</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Mart. 9, 97, 1</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Plin. 37,
				2, 7</span></i>. § 20; <i><span class="en">Dig.
				34, 2, 36 al.</span></i>—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b>
			<i>A scoop-shaped fire-pan</i>, <i><span class="en">Liv. 37,
				11, 13</span></i>.— </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<i>A mason's trowel</i>, <i><span class="en">Pall.
				1, 15</span></i>; <i><span class="en">1, 13, 2</span></i>.— </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>C.</b> = trulleum, <i>a
			basin</i>, <i>wash-basin</i>, <i><span class="en">Juv. 3,
			108</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
    <div class="alpheios-lex-alph-source">From <u>
            <u>A Latin Dictionary</u>
        </u> (Charlton T. Lewis, Charles Short, Oxford, Clarendon Press, 1879) </div>
